<h1>GatherPack Hosting &amp; Pricing</h1>

<p class="lead">GatherPack pricing is simple: self-host free under the MIT license, or use affordable managed hosting via Sledgehammer Infosystems — Standard $50/mo, Custom $100/mo plus plugin development. Same software either way.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-calendar.png" alt="Managed hosting comparison — Standard and Custom tiers" width="827" height="827" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="philosophy" class="card" aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Affordability as a feature</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Many community groups run on small budgets and volunteer time. We keep hosting deliberately affordable and transparent — not the opaque “contact sales” pattern — because cost shouldn’t decide whether a youth club can track its roster. When you need more than standard hosting, Custom adds plugin development to fit your workflow exactly, still at a fixed monthly base.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">If you have technical capacity, self-host at $0 and keep full control. If you’d rather not run servers, managed hosting is the “it just works” path. <a href="/open-source/">Self-host details</a> · <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub source</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

