<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Hosting &amp; pricing FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Is there a free way to use GatherPack?</h3>
    <p>Yes — self-host free under the MIT license. No feature gates; same GatherPack either way. <a href="/open-source/">Self-host details</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">What do managed tiers cost right now?</h3>
    <p>Standard $50/mo, Custom $100/mo plus plugin development, with a significant FIRST discount. <a href="/contact/">Contact for current hosted tiers</a> — we keep the page indexable for “GatherPack pricing / hosting cost” intent without publishing stale numbers.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can we move from hosting to self-host or vice versa?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Because it’s the same open-source software, you keep your data and can change how it’s run. Ask on <a href="https://discord.gg/r3fmNDVn3N" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> or <a href="/contact/">contact</a> for migration help.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a> · <a href="/open-source/">Open source pillar</a></p>
